sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Clin as Clinician
    participant Rad as RadiologyService
    participant Num as RadiologyNumbering
    participant Tech as Radiographer
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Clin->>Rad: Create RadiologyOrder (patientId, modality, clinicalIndication)
    Rad->>Num: Allocate order/accession numbers
    Rad->>DB: Create RadiologyOrder
    Rad->>Audit: audit radiology_order.created
    Tech->>Rad: Schedule/perform study
    Rad->>DB: Create RadiologyStudy linked to order
    Rad->>Audit: audit radiology_study.created
    Tech->>Rad: Report study
    Rad->>DB: Create RadiologyReport
    Rad->>DB: Update order/study status
    Rad->>Audit: audit radiology_report.created
    Note over Rad: Imaging workflow with orders -> studies -> reports
